    {
      "name": "Ever Wake Up To Pee At Night?",
      "char_file": "시계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Waking up to urinate",
        "two or more times",
        "a night isn't just",
        "",
        "a normal part of aging -",
        "it's called nocturia,",
        "and it's worth checking"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "It's Not Always The Prostate",
      "char_file": "신장_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "An enlarged prostate",
        "is only one",
        "possible cause",
        "",
        "evening drinks,",
        "medication timing, and",
        "how well you sleep",
        "all play a role too"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Evening Alcohol And Caffeine",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "First, alcohol and",
        "caffeine in the evening",
        "",
        "Both act as diuretics",
        "and blunt the hormone",
        "that concentrates urine,",
        "",
        "so more fluid",
        "leaves your body overnight"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Blood Pressure Or Diuretic Meds",
      "char_file": "이뇨제_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Second, taking blood",
        "pressure or diuretic",
        "medication close to bedtime",
        "",
        "It's still working",
        "while you sleep,",
        "pushing urine output up",
        "",
        "ask your doctor about",
        "an earlier dose instead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Untreated Sleep Apnea",
      "char_file": "코골이_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Third, loud snoring",
        "or sleep apnea",
        "",
        "Each pause in breathing",
        "changes the pressure",
        "in your chest,",
        "",
        "triggering a hormone",
        "that ramps up",
        "urine production"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "What Actually Helps",
      "char_file": "물컵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Cut alcohol and",
        "caffeine 2 to 3 hours",
        "before bed",
        "",
        "Ask your doctor about",
        "taking BP or diuretic",
        "meds earlier in the day",
        "",
        "If you snore loudly,",
        "ask about a sleep study"
      ]
    }
